            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in FunNotch 1.3</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Dino Run</b> — a second game: an endless runner with a day-to-night sky, gems and a high score. Breakout gets a modern look.</li>
                    <li><b>Focus &amp; Timer</b> are one tab now, with a dial you wind, a timer and a stopwatch.</li>
                    <li>The weather is a small <b>pixel-art landscape</b> that lives.</li>
                    <li><b>Claude Code and Codex</b> tracking rebuilt, with announcements when a session starts, finishes or needs you.</li>
                    <li>Simpler <b>Settings and Customize</b> windows, and a livelier volume and brightness HUD.</li>
                    <li>Fixes: nothing hides under the camera any more, and in-app updates are signed correctly.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
